{"4947720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Parcel Point Simulator", "steam_appid": 4947720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5084570], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/b6704af861a93dbdccfe4c1e2dcd4e0e.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/b6704af861a93dbdccfe4c1e2dcd4e0e.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/b6704af861a93dbdccfe4c1e2dcd4e0e.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Parcel Point Simulator</i> is a cozy management sim game. Starting from a cluttered storefront stacked with cardboard boxes, grow your small parcel point in a bustling community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/61bb238752934724dd4d05e7a321171a.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/61bb238752934724dd4d05e7a321171a.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/61bb238752934724dd4d05e7a321171a.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ececfaa2896e25ee19035a25aab4d57.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ececfaa2896e25ee19035a25aab4d57.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ececfaa2896e25ee19035a25aab4d57.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN THE STORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelve and scan every parcel off the courier truck. Organize them in the way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/15607a313473c0f6e1d8c371c1364253.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/15607a313473c0f6e1d8c371c1364253.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/15607a313473c0f6e1d8c371c1364253.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/9207587e1537f2c4ab2d58a195d47b62.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/9207587e1537f2c4ab2d58a195d47b62.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/9207587e1537f2c4ab2d58a195d47b62.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIT THE STREETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't trap yourself behind the register. Locker or Door-to-Door, load up your cargo trike and deliver to the customers who can't wait. Urgent deliveries pay double in bad weather. Earn enough and upgrade to a box van, then to something… less ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/14c03d9da25d6ccd668bf2b1da702df2.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/14c03d9da25d6ccd668bf2b1da702df2.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/14c03d9da25d6ccd668bf2b1da702df2.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/b6704af861a93dbdccfe4c1e2dcd4e0e.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/b6704af861a93dbdccfe4c1e2dcd4e0e.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/b6704af861a93dbdccfe4c1e2dcd4e0e.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEIGH IT, CHECK IT, PRICE IT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the parcel on the scale, note down what the customer <i>claims</i> is inside, and build the quote — destination, courier, speed, extra padding. Sometimes customers lie. Once the new regulations kick in, that &quot;just-some-clothes&quot; package becomes <i>your</i> fine if you wave it through without opening the box. Trust the scale, not the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ad9d3ef80abbc1f3229149eb70245d9.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ad9d3ef80abbc1f3229149eb70245d9.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ad9d3ef80abbc1f3229149eb70245d9.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ececfaa2896e25ee19035a25aab4d57.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ececfaa2896e25ee19035a25aab4d57.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ececfaa2896e25ee19035a25aab4d57.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIVE THE CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab noodles or buy a lottery when business is slow. Watch the storm roll in over the Oriental Pearl Tower. Wander home under the lamplight after the 2 AM curfew empties the streets. This city doesn't pause when you close the shutters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/a0c9ca8305ef5bbb5a88007d2ff66d10.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/a0c9ca8305ef5bbb5a88007d2ff66d10.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/a0c9ca8305ef5bbb5a88007d2ff66d10.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/9207587e1537f2c4ab2d58a195d47b62.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/9207587e1537f2c4ab2d58a195d47b62.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/9207587e1537f2c4ab2d58a195d47b62.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WATCH THE &quot;KAREN&quot;s</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you get blackmailed. You can pay them off. Or you can say <i>&quot;follow me&quot;</i>, lead them into the back alley where nobody's watching… and let the baseball bat do the negotiating. Just remember to clean up afterward. There's always room in the dumpster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/627cbbab710701fd1f2dc3ea09929964.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/627cbbab710701fd1f2dc3ea09929964.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/627cbbab710701fd1f2dc3ea09929964.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/b6704af861a93dbdccfe4c1e2dcd4e0e.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/b6704af861a93dbdccfe4c1e2dcd4e0e.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/b6704af861a93dbdccfe4c1e2dcd4e0e.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Parcel Point Simulator</i> is a cozy management sim game. Starting from a cluttered storefront stacked with cardboard boxes, grow your small parcel point in a bustling community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/61bb238752934724dd4d05e7a321171a.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.