342157\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/b6704af861a93dbdccfe4c1e2dcd4e0e.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/b6704af861a93dbdccfe4c1e2dcd4e0e.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEIGH IT, CHECK IT, PRICE IT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the parcel on the scale, note down what the customer <i>claims</i> is inside, and build the quote — destination, courier, speed, extra padding. Sometimes customers lie. Once the new regulations kick in, that &quot;just-some-clothes&quot; package becomes <i>your</i> fine if you wave it through without opening the box. Trust the scale, not the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ad9d3ef80abbc1f3229149eb70245d9.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ad9d3ef80abbc1f3229149eb70245d9.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ad9d3ef80abbc1f3229149eb70245d9.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ececfaa2896e25ee19035a25aab4d57.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ececfaa2896e25ee19035a25aab4d57.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/1ececfaa2896e25ee19035a25aab4d57.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIVE THE CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab noodles or buy a lottery when business is slow. Watch the storm roll in over the Oriental Pearl Tower. Wander home under the lamplight after the 2 AM curfew empties the streets. This city doesn't pause when you close the shutters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/a0c9ca8305ef5bbb5a88007d2ff66d10.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/a0c9ca8305ef5bbb5a88007d2ff66d10.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/a0c9ca8305ef5bbb5a88007d2ff66d10.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/9207587e1537f2c4ab2d58a195d47b62.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/9207587e1537f2c4ab2d58a195d47b62.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/9207587e1537f2c4ab2d58a195d47b62.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WATCH THE &quot;KAREN&quot;s</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you get blackmailed. You can pay them off. Or you can say <i>&quot;follow me&quot;</i>, lead them into the back alley where nobody's watching… and let the baseball bat do the negotiating. Just remember to clean up afterward. There's always room in the dumpster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/627cbbab710701fd1f2dc3ea09929964.poster.avif?t=1788342157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/627cbbab710701fd1f2dc3ea09929964.webm?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/extras/627cbbab710701fd1f2dc3ea09929964.mp4?t=1788342157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Pick it, Shelve it, Scan it, Deliver it, Ship it — Grow a corner parcel point into a local logistics empire.", "supported_languages": "English, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, French, German, Ukrainian, Indonesian, Turkish, Czech, Polish, Thai, Dutch, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese, Arabic, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/dea042c69ca0c840fdf289d66563fee186e7e740/header.jpg?t=1788342157", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947720/a7939dcfad1b255719b8194ec2b41c0a529ea2c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788342157", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st